#! rate=44118 block=64 tracks=8 end=207360
# The arpeggiator on the panel (panel-arp.panel): track 1 has one note on
# step 5, which plays through the arp while the sequencer runs; the panel
# records two keys into the clip as they were played, and the arp plays
# them again on the next pass.
@0 bpm 12000;tog 0 4 43 100;slen 0 4 4 -1 90
